OL,3,GNEWSAWales' future in the UK not for
OL,4,AKremlin to exploit, says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' constitutional future within the
OL,7,FUK is for its people and not the
OL,8,FKremlin to endorse or exploit, the
OL,9,Ffirst minister has said.
OL,11,FRhun ap Iorwerth, who attended a
OL,12,Fpro-independence march at the weekend,
OL,13,Fdistanced himself from reported remarks
OL,14,Fby the Russian foreign minister Sergei
OL,15,FLavrov, who questioned whether the UK
OL,16,Fhas a future.
OL,18,FWelsh Conservative Senedd leader Darren
OL,19,FMillar said Lavrov's comments showed
OL,20,Fthe "folly" of focusing on
OL,21,F"constitutional navel gazing".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
