OL,3,GNEWSAWales' future in the UK not for
OL,4,AKremlin to exploit, says first minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking in the Senedd on Tuesday, the
OL,7,Ffirst minister questioned the "wisdom"
OL,8,Fof senior Welsh politicians "quoting a
OL,9,FKremlin propagandist in order to pursue
OL,10,Ftheir unionist agenda here".
